{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a new exciting adventure in World Wonders: Hidden Histories 3! Explore the cultural heritage of eight countries - from the castles of the Czech Republic to the temples of Thailand, from the Canadian landscapes to the streets of Spain. Find hidden objects, solve puzzles and restore forgotten stories woven into the architecture and traditions. Each location offers unique challenges and rare artifacts that will expand your collection. Open new chapters of the World Heritage Chronicles and learn more about the world! Are you ready to uncover even more secrets? Wonders await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for fragments among objects!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all the hidden objects!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel around countries!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the right place for each fragment!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the history of countries!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2495640?t=1754664486","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2495640?t=1754664486","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495640/71235deadfe3dce2295d9d88857b12656f24c633/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754664486","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2495640/71235deadfe3dce2295d9d88857b12656f24c633/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754664486","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a new exciting adventure in World Wonders: Hidden Histories 3! Explore the cultural heritage of eight countries - from the castles of the Czech Republic to the temples of Thailand, from the 